          "type": "text",
          "text": "A parallelogram panel has base 12 cm and height 6 cm. Beside it is a trapezium with parallel sides 10 cm and 12 cm and height 5 cm. Find their combined area in cm². Enter the numerical value only."
        }
      ],
      "marks": 3,
      "primary_outcome": "5.1",
      "secondary_outcomes": [],
      "response": {
        "type": "numeric",
